1. User places order → Order Service publishes "order-placed"
         ↓
2. Payment Service listens → creates Payment record (INITIATED)
         ↓
3. User calls POST /payments/initiate
   → Payment Service creates Razorpay order
   → Returns razorpayOrderId + keyId to frontend
         ↓
4. Frontend opens Razorpay checkout popup
   → User pays via UPI/Card/Netbanking
   → Razorpay returns razorpayPaymentId + signature
         ↓
5. Frontend calls POST /payments/verify
   → Payment Service verifies signature
   → Updates PaymentStatus = SUCCESS
   → Publishes "payment-success" event
         ↓
6. Notification Service listens → sends confirmation email
   Order Service listens → updates order PaymentStatus = PAID